nt status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA ELECTRIC INDUSTRIAL CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIMURA, NAOTO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKUDA, OSAMU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KABESHITA AKIRA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MIMURA NAOTO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OKUDA OSAMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KABESHITA, AKIRA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MIMURA, NAOTO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKUDA, OSAMU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A part sucking nozzle lifter, wherein, when a nozzle is selected, with a piston rod (46) of a nozzle selection cylinder (45) lowered to a bottom position, a clearance (A) is formed always between the piston rod (46) and the upper end of a nozzle lifting rod (55) so as to prevent the piston rod of the cylinder (45) from being in contact with the nozzle lifting rod when the nozzle is selected and, only when a lifting member (58) is lowered by the driving of a liftably driving motor (56), the piston rod (46) touches the nozzle lifting rod (55).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif de relevage de buse par succion partielle, dans lequel, lorsqu'une buse est sélectionnée, la tige de piston (46) d'un vérin de sélection de buse (45) étant abaissée en position inférieure, un espace (A) est toujours formé entre la tige de piston (46) et l'extrémité supérieure d'une tige de relevage de buse (55), de sorte que la tige de piston de vérin (45) ne vienne pas en contact avec la tige de relevage de buse lorsque la buse est sélectionnée et, seulement si un élément de relevage (56) est abaissé au moyen d'un moteur (56) d'entraînement à relevage, la tige de piston (46) touche la tige de relevage de buse (55).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>